WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Crouching medium punch Counter Hits Ryu.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.500
OD Ankensatsu launches from the crouching medium.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.100
